открой alembic.ini
там строка:
sqlalchemy.url = postgresql://prozapas_user:zapas_zapas@localhost:5432/prozapas_db

надо создать юзера постгри:

psql -U postgres

CREATE USER prozapas_user WITH PASSWORD 'zapas_zapas';
CREATE DATABASE prozapas_db
    OWNER prozapas_user
    ENCODING 'UTF8'
    LC_COLLATE 'ru_RU.UTF-8'
    LC_CTYPE 'ru_RU.UTF-8'
    TEMPLATE template0;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE prozapas_db TO prozapas_user;

\q

потом прост 

alembic upgrade head
